{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04080","headline":"奉和圣制漕桥东送新除岳牧 · 苏頲","name":"奉和圣制漕桥东送新除岳牧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝贤不遗俊，台阁尽鵷鸾。\n未若调人切，其如简帝难。\n上才膺出典，中旨念分官。\n特以专城贵，深惟列郡安。\n政行思务本，风靡属胜残。\n有令田知急，无分狱在宽。\n至言题睿札，殊渥洒仙翰。\n诏饯三台降，朝荣万国欢。\n举杯临水发，张乐拥桥观。\n式伫东封会，锵锵检玉坛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04080.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04080","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}